{
  "title": "Realizations of Homology Classes and Projection Areas",
  "authors": [
    "Daoji Huang",
    "June Huh",
    "Mateusz Micha\u0142ek",
    "Botong Wang",
    "Shouda Wang"
  ],
  "year": 2025,
  "arxivId": "2505.08881",
  "abstract": "This paper explores the relationship between convex geometry and algebraic geometry, focusing on the realization of homology classes and projection areas in four-dimensional spaces. The authors provide a characterization of vectors of nonnegative real numbers that can arise as the areas of coordinate projections of a convex body in R4, as well as the degrees of coordinate projections from an irreducible surface to P1 \u00d7 P1.",
  "sections": [
    {
      "title": "The Core Idea",
      "content": "The paper investigates two interconnected problems: one concerning the projection areas of convex bodies in R4, and the other involving the degrees of coordinate projections from an irreducible surface to P1 \u00d7 P1. The authors show that these problems are governed by the Pl\u00fccker relations for the Grassmannian Gr(2, 4) over a triangular hyperfield T2.",
